From 0c5d6f06ee268247ff903e6129e2223c765d0521 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nuubOS Project <nuubos@localhost>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:47:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Add a control channel for a supervising process

With -control, moonlight reports machine readable lines on stdout
(@started, @failed, @terminated, @status, @stats, @pin, @paired, @app,
@host, @error) and reads commands on stdin: STATS reports stream
statistics, QUIT and end of file end the session. A new status action
reports the host name and pairing state.

A failed LiStartConnection() now ends the process instead of entering
the main loop with no session; list and pair failures exit non zero.
